Hello!
Loving this plugin, but I am interested in a feature. I have different qualities that can be applied to an item. Each of them will obviously change the weapon/armor's attributes in some way. But atm I am only having static changes. I was hoping there was a plugin I can combine this with, or if I can use some feature that already exists but that I am unaware of that will increase the main items i.e. ATK stat by 20%.
I am thinking of using the preset trait of increase ATK by %, that does apply the % change to the entire actor's ATK value instead of just the items ATK value.
Any information about this would be greatly appreciated.
EDIT(Solved)
Within the plugin in the "Affix Effects" section I found it. I used the information to make below. i am unsure about what the params are but I assume 3 is DEF since 2 is ATK and that 9 therefore is MMP. Correct me if I am wrong though.
The script below will increase all the base parameters by 10%. By setting the var Bonus to 1.1 you can copy paste it into different affix items and then just change one value to change the overall bonus value.
<Prefix Suffix Effect>
var Bonus = 1.1;
newItem.params[2] *= Bonus;
newItem.params[3] *= Bonus;
newItem.params[4] *= Bonus;
newItem.params[5] *= Bonus;
newItem.params[6] *= Bonus;
newItem.params[7] *= Bonus;
newItem.params[8] *= Bonus;
newItem.params[9] *= Bonus;
newItem.price *= Bonus;
</Prefix Suffix Effect>
Best regards,
Bishiba
